  "details": "1. Edit SteamVR Controller settings for VRChat\n\n2. Under the main or global layer place 'use as joystick' for \"Thumbstick\"\n\n3. set \"Click\" to 'menu'\n\nThis configuration option results in a forced configuration where the leaflet menu and gesture menu are bonded as one action. Which restricts the level of customization available to the end user. \n\nA. short press for leaflet menu\n\nB. Long press for radial/gesture menu",
